; Copy a widget from the skin storage area to the screen
; enter with .X = widget number to copy


; Widget tile skin source locations (top X, top Y, width, height)
; Y<25 = row number in top half of skin.  Y>24 = row (Y-24) in bottom half
; Four bytes per entry, one entry = first (or only) image for the widget

